10216:agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/reviews-d77e5c1/logs/A4-review-sol.log:10076:A concrete gap has emerged in the durability boundary: a brand-new nested `TopicObservationRunner` root is created with recursive `mkdir`, while later fsyncs cover descendants and the root contents but never the new root entry’s parent chain. I’m validating that reachable path under `/tmp` and checking whether the same state transition admits any additional rewrite beyond the intended later-cursor PENDING-to-OBSERVED upgrade.
